# Bulk third-party product data, images and a SQLite database — several hundred
# megabytes at full scale, and not this repository's to redistribute. The
# importer finds the bundle by name at the repository root; keep it there and
# out of version control. `apps/api/scripts/importArogga.ts` documents the shape.
